{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_270","type":"agent_message","text":"The full 912-configuration reach matrix produced only six exact region signatures, all independent of ring position, so the ring is not functioning as a bridge or portal under any static phase. I’m shifting to the irreversible movement evidence: special multicolor glyph cells are erased after the avatar crosses them. That suggests a collect/consume objective across teleport-separated regions, where progress is the remaining non-floor glyph count rather than reachable area."}}
